      "sourceUrl": "https://www.scotcat.com/amblycipitidae/liobagrus_marginatoides.htm",
      "html": "<ul><li><strong>Family:</strong> Amblycipitidae</li><li><strong>Common name:</strong> None</li><li><strong>Synonyms:</strong> Amblyceps marginatoides</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 8.5 cm (3¼ in)</li><li><strong>Temperature:</strong> 18-22°C (63-71°F)</li><li><strong>pH:</strong> 6.5-7.5</li><li><strong>IUCN Red List:</strong> Not Evaluated</li></ul>"
